---
import Layout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Section from "../../components/ui/Section.astro";
import "../../styles/global.css";
import HeroBanner from "../../components/ui/HeroBanner.astro";
import Eyebrow from "../../components/ui/Eyebrow.astro";
import Heading from "../../components/ui/Heading.astro";
import BookDemo from "../../components/ui/BookDemo.astro";
import Blockquote from "../../components/ui/Blockquote.astro";
import FlippingCard from "../../components/ui/FlippingCard.astro";
import LayoutSection from "../../components/ui/LayoutSection.astro";
---

<Layout>

   <LayoutSection containerSize="full" padding="p-0">
        <div class="text-center text-shadow-md text-shadow-neutral-950">
         <HeroBanner height="sm" image="../../assets/images/work-mgmt-banner-01.jpg">
      <h1 class="text-6xl font-medium leading-tight text-white lg:text-6xl">
        Work Management Optimization
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-3xl leading-8 text-white">
        Improve the velocity of workflow thorough your system by 50%!
      </p>
    </HeroBanner>
        </div>
  </LayoutSection>

  <LayoutSection containerSize="7xl" padding="py-8">
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10 lg:gap-14"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 divide-y divide-neutral-300">
        <div class="pb-6">
          <Eyebrow class="text-black">
            THE PIPELINE OF WORK EXECUTION VELOCITY
          </Eyebrow>

          <Heading class="mb-4 " level={3}>
            <span class=""
              >What Would You Do With 50% More Maintenance Capacity?</span
            >
          </Heading>
          <p>
            We are all trying to do more with less and the
            <strong>maintenance team</strong>, is no exception. They feel they
            could definitely use more resources, but fail to baseline,
            uncovering that the current system is only
            <span class="text-orange-400 font-bold"
              > performing at about 50%
            </span>of it’s true potential. The major breakthrough is a process
            that identifies and analyzes the velocity of workflow and manageable
            items that limit your effectiveness and efficiency. The result can
            mitigate the risk of attrition, dependency on outside resources and
            lower the overall costs of your<strong>
              maintenance & reliability efforts.</strong
            >
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-3 mb-10 max-w-127.5 mx-auto">
          <blockquote class="relative">
            <p
              class={`text-lg italic font-medium  text-center" : " leading-normal`}
            >
              “Just because we had a Planning function, we thought it was
              working fine…what we quickly learned is that our craftspeople
              dealt with a tremendous amount of “invisible” delay that was
              accepted as normal and could have been minimized”
            </p>
          </blockquote>

          <span class="block text-right mt-2 italic">~ Maintenance Manager</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl mb-4">
          <span class="block text-accent">
            Learn how we uncover hidden capacity.
          </span>
        </h2>
        <!-- ../images/asset-criticality-02-640x319.jpg -->
        <BookDemo
          backgroundImage="../../assets/images/work-mgmt-block-02-640x360.jpg"
          buttonLabel="CLICK TO BOOK A DEMO"
          href="/book-demo"
          minHeight="20rem"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </LayoutSection>

  <LayoutSection containerSize="7xl" padding="py-8" shape="diagonal-reverse" class="bg-white" padding="py-40" >
<div
        class="grid  grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-10 lg:gap-14 "
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <div class="mb-4">
            <Heading level={5} class="mb-4 ">
              <span>Problems We Solve…</span>
            </Heading>
            <ul
              class="list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6 marker:text-sky-700 mt-4"
            >
              <li>Don’t know what our productivity is</li>
              <li>
                We have planners but they don’t spend much time planning –
                rather expediting
              </li>
              <li>
                Don’t know where our bottlenecks are and how to improve flow
              </li>
              <li>
                Little visibility and reporting on workflow, planning &
                scheduling
              </li>
              <li>Our job plans primarily focus on PM’s not corrective work</li>
              <li>
                Common / repetitive jobs are not standardized requiring higher
                skills
              </li>
              <li>Need a way to get more work done with less resources</li>
              <li>Reduce risk in attrition-based knowledge loss</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="my-6">
            <Heading level={5} class="mb-4 ">
              <span>Solution Details…</span>
            </Heading>
            <p>
              Our process, tools and training will take your work management
              program to a whole new level. You will be able to set up a system
              that opens the flow/velocity of work, controls the way work is
              identified & prioritized, backlog management, planning, weekly
              allocation, daily scheduling, work execution productivity and
              full-range program analytics. Improving your work management
              program will release untapped capacity to internalize concentrated
              work, manage overtime, allow for attrition and drive down overall
              costs.
            </p>

            <ul
              class="list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6 marker:text-sky-700 mt-4"
            >
              <li>Corrective maintenance job plan builder</li>
              <li>Job Plan master library</li>
              <li>Productivity Analysis (Mobile app for identifying controllable delay impacting the craft)</li>
              <li>Planning & scheduling compliance</li>
              
            </ul>
          </div>


         

        </div>
        <div class="col-span-2">
          <Blockquote
            class="max-w-7xl mx-auto border-none shadow-none"
            variant="quote"
            textColor="text-accent"
          >
            Maintenance productivity currently only averages 27%!
          </Blockquote>

          <div class="mt-8">
            <Heading level={5} class="mb-4 ">
              <span>What we offer…</span>
            </Heading>
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <FlippingCard
                class="offer-flip"
                minHeight="16rem"
                frontTitle="360Navigator SaaS Work Management Suite"
                frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
                backText="Full automation of reporting, analytics and optimization of work execution management"
              />
              <FlippingCard
                class="offer-flip"
                minHeight="16rem"
                frontTitle="Performance Management Analytics"
                frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
                backText="Ready for Use dynamic performance management analytics of your work management system."
              />
              <FlippingCard
                class="offer-flip"
                minHeight="16rem"
                frontTitle="Standard Work Plan Optimization"
                frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
                backText="Analytics driven job selection and plan optimization for standardized work and work execution impact"
              />
               <FlippingCard
                class="offer-flip"
                minHeight="16rem"
                frontTitle="Craft Productivity Baselining and Analysis"
                frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
                backText="Increase work velocity and staff capacity by identifying and analyzing the manageable obstacles limiting craft productivity by 50%"
              />
              <FlippingCard
                class="offer-flip"
                minHeight="16rem"
                frontTitle="Workflow Design and Optimization"
                frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
                backText="Design the optimum workflow, measures and reporting for maximum control and efficiency"
              />
              <FlippingCard
                class="offer-flip"
                minHeight="16rem"
                frontTitle="Training and Coaching Programs"
                frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
                backText="Hands-on, remote and on-demand eLearning training programs for the entire work management process"
              />
            </div>

            <Heading level={6} class="my-4  text-right italic">
              <span class="text-neutral-500 font-medium"
                >Complete solutions to optimize your work execution management.
              </span
              >
            </Heading>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col">
            <Heading level={5} class=" mb-4">
              <span
                >Your work management program is the both the pipeline and bottleneck…</span
              >
            </Heading>
            <p>
              …of how much work gets done and hides a tremendous amount of untapped valuable capacity. From the way work is identified, planned, scheduled and executed, 
              this process the core of how effective and efficient your program operates.
            </p>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
  </LayoutSection>

  <LayoutSection containerSize="7xl" padding="py-8">
 <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-10 lg:gap-14">
   <div>
<Heading level={5} class="mb-4 ">
            <span class="block text-accent"> Ready to solve these problems?</span>
          </Heading>
              <ul class="list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-6 marker:text-sky-700 mt-4">
                <li>The perception that if you have planners, planning is effective</li>
                <li>We can’t justify planners or a planning role…</li>
                <li>Crafts won’t want to participate in velocity studies</li>
                              <li>Difficult time quantifying the impact of inefficiency</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
              <div class="col-span-2">
                <BookDemo
                  backgroundImage="../../assets/images/bgn-quotes.jpg"
                  buttonLabel="CLICK TO BOOK A REVIEW SESSION"
                  href="/book-demo"
                  minHeight="12rem"
                  demoHeading="Learn how your system is limiting craft productivity and restricting the velocity of workflow."
                />
              </div>
 </div>
  </LayoutSection>


</Layout>
